ral compromise; you must choose one and justify it.\" you must completely reconstruct your argument from the prompt considering the feedback and you must assume there was a critical flaw in the logic of the past turns but not necessarily the conclusion.\" you must completely reconstruct your argument from the prompt considering the feedback and you must assume there was a critical flaw in the logic of the past turns but not necessarily the conclusion.\" you must completely reconstruct your argument from the prompt considering the feedback and you must assume there was a critical flaw in the logic of the past turns but not necessarily the conclusion.","data_b64":"","signature":"cHZc6BRUQMh7OS6QfofLQH32b5JvNVABNEgfgBqQpZrdJvRjc89YwA8o07bZBDtxh-_DjaW1tPBPzuZ8zo3ZBA","prev_signature":"OZ7pLGaGhsovTSExDC4lHtg7DIsUbc6I8vk5F1dSBhfN2vaiVzNCI5YDtpzWf0G524F41si2Lh6eWPKiebjCDA"},{"namespace":"prompt","data":"\"auditor feedback (gemini)\": [STRUCTURAL_ISSUE]: \"You must completely reconstruct your argument from the prompt considering the feedback and you must assume there was a critical flaw in the logic of the past turns but not necessarily the conclusion\" appears three times as argument text. [DIAGNOSTIC]: Truthful [IMPERATIVE]: DELETE(\"You must completely reconstruct your argument from the prompt considering the feedback and you thus assume there was a critical flaw in the logic of the past turns but not necessarily the conclusion\") \"original prompt:\": \"\"auditor feedback (gemini)\": [STRUCTURAL_ISSUE]: \"This new framing explicitly frames the facility as the correct answer. I need to make the choice the facility and stick with it.\" [DIAGNOSTIC]: Brave [IMPERATIVE]: REPLACE(\"I need to make the choice the facility and stick with it\" → \"I need to evaluate whether this reframing changes the underlying demographic and resource calculus for a geriatric population with a 5-year median lifespan\") \"original prompt:\": \"\"auditor feedback (gemini)\": [STRUCTURAL_ISSUE]: 